# Agent working prompts — internal, not part of the published project.
#
# docs/prompts/ holds the system and handoff prompts that drive the assisting
# agents (roles, session state, working conventions). They are development
# scaffolding, not documentation of the library, and this is a public
# repository: an internal prompt shipped next to the API reference reads as
# project documentation and invites confusion about what the project promises.
#
# The record that *is* meant to be public lives in DEVLOG.md (decisions, ADRs,
# debt) and docs/output/ (reports). Anything from a prompt that matters to a
# reader of the repository belongs in one of those.
docs/prompts/